  "text": "The regulations may make provision about the practice and procedure of prescribed courts in an action or proceeding under this Act, including provision: (a) prescribing the time for starting the action or proceeding or for doing any other act or thing; or (b) for an extension of that time. Note: For prescribed court see section 190.",
